    "title": "See Coachella 2026 first week lineup, daily schedule, livestream, more",
    "text": "Don't be surprised if you see content from The Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival all down your social media timelines.The massive music event returns this weekend for its 25th iteration at the Empire Polo Club in Indio, California. The biggest stars, including headliners Sabrina Carpenter, Justin Bieber, and Karol G, will hit the stage with unforgettable performances.According to the Palm Springs Desert Sun, part of the USA TODAY Network, Coachella is sold out. However, you can still get verified resale tickets for weekend one until Friday, April 10, at 10 a.m. PDT.Here's what you need to know about the first weekend of Coachella 2026, including the full lineup and how to watch from home if you can't make it to the festival in person.Coachella at 25: The moments that turned a music festival into a phenomenonHow to watch Coachella 2026 on livestreamJustin Bieber performs with Daniel Caesar onstage at the Coachella Stage during the 2022 Coachella Valley Music And Arts Festival on April 15, 2022 in Indio, California.Fans can watch Coachella performances on YouTube on April 10 starting at 4 p.m. PT/ 7 p.m. ET. Through the YouTube app on your TV, you can stream multiple stages simultaneously from your couch. Streams are available for the Main Stage, Outdoor Theatre, Sahara, Mojave, Gobi, Sonora and Quasar.The festival is also bringing back \"Watch With,\" which lets viewers watch events alongside their favorite content creators via livestream on their respective channels on TV, desktop, or mobile, according to the website.Fans also have the option to download the Coachella Livestream app to stream the show, rewatch highlights, and keep up with other related news.Coachella 2026 Week 1 headliners, key performancesSabrina Carpenter performs at the Coachella Stage during the 2024 Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival at Empire Polo Club on April 19, 2024 in Indio, California.Friday: Pop star Sabrina Carpenter will headline the festival. Other performers include KATSEYE, Teddy Swims, Sexyy Red, Central Cee, Foster the People, Lykke Li, and Blood Orange.Saturday: Justin Bieber is slated to headline. Giveon, Swae Lee, Addison Rae, The Strokes, Sombr, Davido, PinkPantheress, and Labrinth are also on the lineup.Sunday: Karol G will close the weekend. Fans can also expect to see Young Thug, FKA twigs, BIGBANG, Little Simz, Major Lazer, and Clipse, among others.Coachella 2026 set timesKarol G performs on the Coachella stage during the 2022 Coachella Valley Music And Arts Festival on April 24, 2022 in Indio, California.A complete list of day-by-day set times can be found on Coachella's website or in an Instagram post below:Contributing: Ema Sasic, Niki Kottmann, Palm Springs Desert SunMore in EntertainmentTaylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.This article originally appeared on USA TODAY: Coachella 2026 lineup, daily schedule, set times, how to watch live",
